      <ul>
        <li>Hummer: 8 generators → 48V bus · target ≥12,000W combined at 200 PSI</li>
        <li>M1A3: 16 generators → 840V bus · target ≥28,000W combined at 300 PSI</li>
        <li>Bus voltage stability: ripple &lt;1% after rectification and filtering</li>
        <li>Winding temperature after 60-min run: &lt;120°C (Class H)</li>
        <li>Cannon cap bank charge time: Hummer &lt;5 sec · M1A3 &lt;22 sec</li>
        <li>Pass/fail: all output targets met · temp limit · cap charge time</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="test-card" data-num="T4">
