        <li>Aerogel wrap heat retention: &gt;30% vs unwrapped at 150 PSI</li>
        <li>Fitting torque check after cycling: no loosening</li>
        <li>Pass/fail: burst &gt;400 PSI · no fretting · aerogel confirmed</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="test-card" data-num="T5">
