      <ul>
        <li>Civilian: 90 PSI input · continuous rotation confirmed · &lt;10% torque ripple</li>
        <li>Combat: 200/300 PSI input · 4-rail simultaneous · torque balance within 5%</li>
        <li>1,000 continuous rail cycles: rail surface wear profilometry after</li>
        <li>Rotary seal: zero steam weep at all test pressures</li>
        <li>180° phase offset verification: no dead-spots in shaft rotation</li>
        <li>Pass/fail: continuous rotation · &lt;10% ripple · zero weep · wear within spec</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="test-card" data-num="T6">
