        <li>Bore temperature after 3 shots: &lt;900°C with LN₂ active cooling</li>
        <li>Blast shield: measure impulse at 5m · crew compartment isolation verified</li>
        <li>Pass/fail: 0.4c velocity (extrapolated from 0.1c test) · temp limit · isolation confirmed</li>
